// The spawn CALL form captures its receiver exactly like an argument:
// `spawn c.bump()` hands `c` to the spawned task, so the unlocked
// blueprint capture is refused with the same diagnostic the argument
// form and the block form produce. (Regression pin: before the fix only
// the arguments were walked — the receiver slipped past the discipline.)
blueprint Counter {
    int count = 0

    fn bump() {
        self.count += 1
    }
}

fn main() {
    new Counter c()
    spawn c.bump()
    c.bump()
}
